    review_mode: full
    review_visible: true
    writing_visible: true
    venue: emnlp-2026
    focus: 'This is a pivot from a failed entrainment hypothesis to an equalizer effect
      discovery. Key concerns: (1) only LAMBADA shows clear convergence — is the finding
      too narrow? (2) n=3 architectures — sufficient? (3) differentiation from Wang
      et al. who have the model zoo and noted qualitative convergence. (4) no 7B scale
      yet — two scales enough? Assess whether the equalizer paradox (aggregate convergence
      + per-example divergence) is novel and interesting enough for EMNLP Findings/Main.'
